<title>SWITZERLAND: Ciba SC Q1 sales rise 19 pct.</title>
<headline>Ciba SC Q1 sales rise 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended March 31.</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p>Group sales by division</p>
<p> Additives			587		 vs 519</p>
<p> Consumer Care		  289		 vs 237</p>
<p> Performance Polymers	 386		 vs 317</p>
<p> Pigments			 320		 vs 266</p>
<p> Textile Dyes		   332		 vs 273</p>
<p> Total Group		    1,914	     vs 1,612</p>
<p>Note - Full name Ciba Specialty Chemicals Inc. Company was spun off from Novartis Inc earlier this year.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
